dsh-lark-cli-skills
===================

This package redistributes agent skill documentation that originates from the
Lark/Feishu CLI project.

Upstream project
----------------
  Package : @larksuite/cli
  Repo    : https://github.com/larksuite/cli
  License : MIT
  Copyright (c) Lark Technologies / Feishu

The files under skills/ are exported verbatim from the lark-cli binary via
`lark-cli skills list` and `lark-cli skills read`. Their wording, structure and
examples belong to the upstream project. This repository only:

  - materialises them as files on disk,
  - registers them with the DeepSeek Harness skill registry, and
  - ships them alongside the plugin glue code.

No upstream skill text is edited, and no authorship of that text is claimed.

Bundled plugin code
-------------------
Everything outside skills/ — lib/, scripts/, cordis.patch.yml, package.json —
is original work of this repository and is licensed MIT.

